## Promotional Text

Build thriving data center campuses, lock in friendly contracts, and return to progress—not punishment. Your next company legacy starts here.

## Description

Who keeps the internet running while the world sleeps? You do.

Start with an empty plot. Build a data center, install power and cooling, fill the floor with servers, and sign capacity contracts. Read the market, choose the right contract length, and grow one practical decision at a time.

FEATURES

• A calm idle business — collect capped offline earnings and a clear shift report when you return.
• Contracts you can trust — sign at a known rate, renew automatically, and keep a free, non-expiring switch opportunity.
• Campuses with a purpose — group matching racks, specialize each park, and expand across distinct campus types.
• A company that remembers — restructure after an IPO, allocate board specialties, and carry permanent progress into your next run.
• No mandatory daily chores — inquiries never expire, declines have no penalty, and faults reduce output before repairing automatically.
• People behind the numbers — meet recurring clients, build relationships, read duty logs, and spot the data center cat on its rounds.

Build reliable capacity, find your rhythm, and turn a modest server room into a lasting company legacy.

## What's New

Version 1.0 introduces the complete launch experience: three technology eras, multi-campus construction, fixed-rate client contracts, optional inquiries, company restructuring, offline shift reports, and full English and Simplified Chinese support.

## App Review Notes

The game has no mandatory advertising. All four rewarded-video entries are optional:

1. Offline income ×2: return after an offline period and use the reward button in the shift report.
2. Instant rack repair: open Operations, choose a data center, open Racks, then select a faulted rack.
3. Construction acceleration: open the construction queue and use “Watch rewarded video” on an active project to remove 30 minutes.
4. Emergency maintenance fund: enter maintenance arrears, then use “Claim emergency fund” in the arrears card.

Restore Purchases is in Store → Compliance & Support → Restore Purchases.

Sandbox verification for the eight internal SKU identifiers:

1. Sign into an Apple sandbox tester and launch a sandbox-signed build.
2. Open Store from either “+” resource shortcut and confirm all products load localized prices.
3. Purchase `gems_s`, `gems_m`, and `gems_l`; confirm the corresponding gem balances increase once per completed transaction.
4. Purchase `pack_starter`, `pack_builder`, and `pack_tycoon` after their stated progression gates; confirm each limited pack can be granted only once.
5. Purchase `noads`; confirm each of the four rewarded benefits is delivered directly without video playback.
6. Purchase `offline24`; confirm the displayed offline earning cap changes from 8 hours to 24 hours.
7. Reinstall or use a second sandbox device, select Restore Purchases, and confirm `noads` and `offline24` return while consumables are not re-granted.

